    HinduFestival(name: "Holika Dahan", date: "2026-03-03", year: 2026, type: .majorFestival, description: "Sacred bonfires are lit at sunset to symbolize the burning of the demoness Holika and the miraculous survival of the devotee Prahlada. Celebrates the victory of devotion over evil. A total lunar eclipse occurs on this night in 2026.", deity: "Vishnu · Prahlada", significance: "Victory of devotion · Burning of ego · Protection"),
